  title: E N C O R E
  button: ENCORE
  riddle: A record, a disc, a microphone, a stick and a harmonica. Find the light
    that lets them sing.
  hint: Light from the right and a little below. The two discs become the notes;
    the microphone and drumstick hold them up.
  complete: 'ENCORE

    Two notes, played by everything on the shelf.'
